Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 想要发财先辞职
Segment #2   [00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,320] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为上班真的很耽误赚钱
Segment #3   [00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,860] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 从我的角度上来说
Segment #4   [00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,760] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 8  | Text: 一人如果想要赚到钱
Segment #5   [00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,500] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 9  | Text: 我是说真正的那种利润
Segment #6   [00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,720] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 打工是完全做不到的
Segment #7   [00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:13,160] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 12 | Text: 那你一定要有一个自己小规模的生意
Segment #8   [00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,180] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 4  | Text: 或者说业务
Segment #9   [00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,120] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 先要把自己的大脑
Segment #10  [00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,880] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 12 | Text: 进化成一个生意人该有的水平
Segment #11  [00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,420] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 这是你发财的第一步
Segment #12  [00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,420] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 而打工或者说上班
Segment #13  [00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,920] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 9  | Text: 它的本质就是拒绝你发展
Segment #14  [00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,220] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 5  | Text: 拒绝你进步
Segment #15  [00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:28,740] | Elapsed:  14.12s | Words: 16 | Text: 逼着你把这个成长的可能性去给他放弃掉
Segment #16  [00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,980] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 11 | Text: 你只是通过单一的体力劳动
Segment #17  [00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:32,580] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 11 | Text: 在别人的体系里轰手饭吃
Segment #18  [00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:33,860] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 你可以想想看
Segment #19  [00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,280] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我们上班的
Segment #20  [00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,200] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 在一个整个的过程
Segment #21  [00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:39,400] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 15 | Text: 你是不是都是在靠单一的付出来取得回报
Segment #22  [00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,820] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 14 | Text: 要么是机械化的重复去做一件事
Segment #23  [00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:45,360] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 13 | Text: 要么就是去完成一个所谓的任务清单
Segment #24  [00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,400] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 围着一个指标团团转
Segment #25  [00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,640] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 要么就是去
Segment #26  [00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:49,940] | Elapsed:  30.51s | Words: 3  | Text: 重复去
Segment #27  [00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,880] | Elapsed:  30.52s | Words: 14 | Text: 跟那个工厂的螺丝一样去做一件事
Segment #28  [00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,660] | Elapsed:  30.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 所谓的倒点下班
Segment #29  [00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,960] | Elapsed:  30.52s | Words: 14 | Text: 更是这种机械化付出的极致体系
Segment #30  [00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,660] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为允许你倒点下班的公司
Segment #31  [00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,400] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 9  | Text: 说白了你为此付出的
Segment #32  [00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,740] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 13 | Text: 就仅仅就是你每天8个小时的时间
Segment #33  [00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,420] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 说难停点就出卖
Segment #34  [00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:08,180] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 10 | Text: 8个小时浪费8个小时
Segment #35  [00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:09,360] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 我告诉你你做不做事
Segment #36  [00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,680] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 这都不是最重要的了
Segment #37  [00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,540] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 你只要把时间熬满了
Segment #38  [00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:13,900] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 这才是最重要的
Segment #39  [00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:15,240] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 这样的付出929值
Segment #40  [00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:18,020] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 10 | Text: 就会把人去给他异化掉
Segment #41  [00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:20,920] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 16 | Text: 会让人只懂得去靠单一的付出去拿钱
Segment #42  [00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,060] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 如果说是这样
Segment #43  [00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:22,860] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 2  | Text: 那你就
Segment #44  [00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:26,000] | Elapsed:  47.23s | Words: 16 | Text: 你就会发现你越来越离不开这种公司了
Segment #45  [00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,060] | Elapsed:  66.08s | Words: 10 | Text: 越来越离不开你的那个组织
Segment #46  [00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:29,560] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为只有这个组织
Segment #47  [00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:32,000] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 13 | Text: 才会愿意为你这个单一的体力时间
Segment #48  [00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,520] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 你所付出的每天
Segment #49  [00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,800] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 无论是6小时也好
Segment #50  [00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:35,540] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 8小时也罢
Segment #51  [00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:36,600] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 去支付报仇
Segment #52  [00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,720] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 11 | Text: 一旦你脱离了这个合作体系
Segment #53  [00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:41,680] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 14 | Text: 你基本上没有任何能拿得出手的东西
Segment #54  [00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,720] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 12 | Text: 你能拿出手的就是你廉价的时间
Segment #55  [00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,200] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 你去换钱上工地班转
Segment #56  [00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,040] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 那一天150
Segment #57  [00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,560] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 去送外卖一天120
Segment #58  [00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:48,960] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 穷人的时间
Segment #59  [00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:49,600] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 劳动力
Segment #60  [00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:52,000] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 12 | Text: 这些付出的东西真的太廉价了
Segment #61  [00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:54,220] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 而且人能支付的劳动力
Segment #62  [00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:55,480] | Elapsed:  66.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 和时间是有限的
Segment #63  [00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:56,760] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 你可以这样过5年
Segment #64  [00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,300] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 3  | Text: 过10年
Segment #65  [00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,200] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 3  | Text: 过20年
Segment #66  [00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,220] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 但20年之后呢
Segment #67  [00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:00,440] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 你要干不动了呢
Segment #68  [00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,840] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 12 | Text: 又不知道你靠其他的什么东西去换钱
Segment #69  [00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,620] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 那你这辈子
Segment #70  [00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:05,660] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 赚钱基本上也就到头了
Segment #71  [00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:06,940] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 拒绝上班
Segment #72  [00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:09,480] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 14 | Text: 本质上是拒绝自己进行单一的培养
Segment #73  [00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:13,020] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 15 | Text: 拒绝自己固定的把自己固化成某一类人
Segment #74  [00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:14,740] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 也是同时给自己留一个
Segment #75  [00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:17,480] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 14 | Text: 靠其他业务模型去赚钱的一个可能性
Segment #76  [00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,300] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 把自己的可塑性发挥在
Segment #77  [00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:21,160] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 离钱最近的地方
Segment #78  [00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:22,800] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 2  | Text: 也是离
Segment #79  [00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,680] | Elapsed:  83.71s | Words: 10 | Text: 也就是这个独立生财的本身
Segment #80  [00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,860] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 赚钱看的是综合元素
Segment #81  [00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:28,040] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 你们能不能动
Segment #82  [00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,080] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 视频看到这了
Segment #83  [00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,980] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 你们可以点赞收藏多看几遍
Segment #84  [00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:32,520] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 我前两天开播的时候
Segment #85  [00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,440] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 我跟一个粉丝联赖
Segment #86  [00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,540] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 他就问我
Segment #87  [00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:36,120] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 说都有什么业务可以做
Segment #88  [00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:36,720] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 3  | Text: 我说有
Segment #89  [00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,160] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是对人类要求很高
Segment #90  [00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,000] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 我说你得什么都会
Segment #91  [00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,100] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 3  | Text: 而且不会的时候
Segment #92  [00:02:41,100 --> 00:02:42,560] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 还能够去积极的去学
Segment #93  [00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,540] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 换句话说
Segment #94  [00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:45,420] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是要有这种成长的能力
Segment #95  [00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:47,180] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后他就跟我交流他的现状
Segment #96  [00:02:47,180 --> 00:02:48,280] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 他过去10年
Segment #97  [00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,120] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就是一直吃黄粱的
Segment #98  [00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,740] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 12 | Text: 然后最近做了这个所谓的停薪留职
Segment #99  [00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:54,340] | Elapsed: 102.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是编制还挂着
Segment #100 [00:02:54,340 --> 00:02:55,660] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是人可以不用来了
Segment #101 [00:02:55,660 --> 00:02:56,860] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 社保我继续给你交着
Segment #102 [00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:57,600] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是没有工资
Segment #103 [00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:58,460] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 说白了
Segment #104 [00:02:58,460 --> 00:03:00,220] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 在跟失业没啥太大的区别
Segment #105 [00:03:00,540 --> 00:03:01,320] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 那很显然
Segment #106 [00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,860] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 在这种环境下待久了
Segment #107 [00:03:02,860 --> 00:03:04,040] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 我感觉整个人
Segment #108 [00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:05,460] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 包括他脑子里装的东西
Segment #109 [00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:07,180] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 11 | Text: 他就跟报处没有太大的区别了
Segment #110 [00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:08,360] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 对人生来说
Segment #111 [00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,680] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 我们每一个选择都是有因果的
Segment #112 [00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:13,280] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 11 | Text: 我个人其实非常非常不建议去进
Segment #113 [00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,380] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 去进体制的
Segment #114 [00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:17,680] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 越是没有实力的家庭
Segment #115 [00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,760] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 11 | Text: 后代往往不要去送到体制里
Segment #116 [00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,060] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为体制打磨人
Segment #117 [00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:22,600] | Elapsed: 120.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 就会把人打磨成一颗
Segment #118 [00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,720] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 11 | Text: 体制内的一颗小螺丝一样
Segment #119 [00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,020] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 后代的
Segment #120 [00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:27,180] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是普通人的后代
Segment #121 [00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,380] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 对怕的就是被定型
Segment #122 [00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:31,160] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 14 | Text: 最怕的就是被没有前途的东西给定型
Segment #123 [00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,580] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 10 | Text: 你往上爬这个东西太累了
Segment #124 [00:03:33,580 --> 00:03:34,760] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个路也太卷了
Segment #125 [00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:35,940] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 它在参考几个因素
Segment #126 [00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:36,800] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 1  | Text: 首先
Segment #127 [00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,480] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 这样玩意你得看关系
Segment #128 [00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:39,960] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 也看自己会不会来事
Segment #129 [00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,820] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是普通家庭的后代
Segment #130 [00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:43,340] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 它怎么可能会有这些呢
Segment #131 [00:03:43,340 --> 00:03:44,400] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 那如果说有
Segment #132 [00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,920] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 12 | Text: 我当初我也不会选择进来进体制
Segment #133 [00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:47,740] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 是不是这个道理
Segment #134 [00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:49,780] | Elapsed: 136.57s | Words: 9  | Text: 赚钱它是一个独立的世界
